>Distress signalling quick card
Stay somewhere safe and tell rescuers your location when possible.
UK hills: sound six whistle blasts or give six torch flashes, wait one minute, repeat. Continue while safe after a reply. In the UK call 999 or 112 and ask for Police, then Mountain Rescue in the hills. Give location, injuries, group size and a return number.

